<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>나만의 웹 아카이브</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .bookmark-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 18px 15px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #2c3e50;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .bookmark-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            background-color: #357abd;
            color: #ffffff;
            border-color: #357abd;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>📌 Quick Link Archive</h1>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- 버튼 수정 구역: href에 주소, 태그 사이에 이름 입력 -->
        <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank" class="bookmark-btn">구글</a>
        <a href="https://www.naver.com" target="_blank" class="bookmark-btn">네이버</a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com" target="_blank" class="bookmark-btn">유튜브</a>
        <a href="https://www.github.com" target="_blank" class="bookmark-btn">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://news.google.com" target="_blank" class="bookmark-btn">구글 뉴스</a>
        <!-- 필요할 때 아래 줄을 복사해서 추가하세요 -->
        <!-- <a href="원하는URL" target="_blank" class="bookmark-btn">버튼이름</a> -->
    </div>

</body>
</html>
